  <div class="scene-help">Drag to orbit · Scroll to zoom · Select a disc</div>
  <div id="carouselInspector" class="scene-inspector"><span class="eyebrow">Carousel</span><strong id="carouselInspectorTitle">No slot selected</strong><p id="carouselInspectorDetail" class="muted">Select a disc to inspect its live state.</p><div class="scene-slot-actions" aria-label="Selected slot actions"><button id="slotLoadButton" type="button" disabled onclick="performSelectedSlotAction('load')">Load</button><button id="slotMountButton" type="button" disabled onclick="performSelectedSlotAction('mount')">Mount</button><button id="slotUnmountButton" type="button" disabled onclick="performSelectedSlotAction('unmount')">Unmount</button><button id="slotEjectButton" class="danger" type="button" disabled onclick="performSelectedSlotAction('eject')">Eject</button></div></div>
</section>
<div class="scene-legend" aria-label="Carousel color legend"><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-swatch audio"></i>Audio</span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-swatch dvd"></i>DVD</span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-swatch data"></i>Data</span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-swatch ripped"></i>Ripped</span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-swatch active"></i>Active slot</span></div>
<p class="visualization-note muted">The model follows live inventory and hardware operations. Moving the view never sends a command to the changer.</p>
